From: RCTools GPU audit
Subject: [PATCH EXPERIMENTAL] X11: pipeline two MIT-SHM frames with completion events

Base: VirtualGL/virtualgl 2473cf39bdbe88ca41ecd58ac4007385c9682a9f

The Channel V5 proof bridge validated this presentation model on TigerVNC:
two MIT-SHM buffers in flight, XShmPutImage(..., True), ShmCompletion-driven
reuse, and no per-frame XSync.

Add the same mechanism behind VGL_KGSL_ASYNC_XSHM=1.  It is accepted only when
VGL_DISPLAY=eglkgsl and VirtualGL is not in synchronous transport mode.
The normal X11 transport remains unchanged otherwise.

This patch is source-build validation only until real-device A/B testing
confirms image ordering, resize behavior, stability, and performance.

